  "details": "When a networked trigger (e.g., Always, AlwaysBufferOne, etc) specifies a receiver object whose path contains non-english characters (e.g. あ), the trigger fails to sync and is processed only locally.\n\n同期される系統のトリガー（Always, AlwaysBufferOne等）のレシーバー（操作されるオブジェクト）のパースに日本語など英数字以外の文字が入ると同期されず、ローカル処理になるようです。\n\nThis issue can be reproduced in this world: wrld_8436c405-2a22-4e2a-b906-b25301ea05de\n\nWhen this occurs, clients other than the instigator of the event record log entries like the following:\n\n019.08.07 18:12:05 Error      -  Failed to deserialize, no parameters will be returned: The given key was not present in the dictionary.\n\n\n2019.08.07 18:12:05 Error      -  [Network Transport] Object reference not set to an instance of an object\n  at VRC.EventReplicator`2[EventType,EventEqualityComparerType].ProcessEvent (.EventType IDEBDKLHCIL, .NIABNINJNDO PNOEAECINHJ) [0x00000] in <filename unknown>:0 \n  at VRC_EventLog+EventReplicator.OnEvent (ExitGames.Client.Photon.EventData PFKHDHNPAOM) [0x00000] in <filename unknown>:0 \n  at (wrapper delegate-invoke) System.Action`1<ExitGames.Client.Photon.EventData>:invoke_void__this___EventData (ExitGames.Client.Photon.EventData)\n  at (wrapper delegate-invoke) System.Action`1<ExitGames.Client.Photon.EventData>:invoke_void__this___EventData (ExitGames.Client.Photon.EventData)\n  at (wrapper delegate-invoke) System.Action`1<ExitGames.Client.Photon.EventData>:invoke_void__this___EventData (ExitGames.Client.Photon.EventData)\n  at EBGFDKCCHCP.OnEvent (ExitGames.Client.Photon.EventData IEBCGNGBNCH) [0x00000] in <filename unknown>:0 \n  at HHJPALCLDKE.OnEvent (ExitGames.Client.Photon.EventData IEBCGNGBNCH) [0x00000] in <filename unknown>:0",
